      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **50+ agencies/teams using it** (prove demand at scale)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Position as **\"Vercel for PocketBase\"** (make it about deployment/hosting, not just tooling)"
