      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**What it would take:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Pivot to standalone platform** (not just VS Code extension)"
        }
      ]
    },
