      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-109",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**My take:** This is a **great GitHub side project** that could get acquired by GitHub/Cursor/Replit, but not a standalone company."
