    },
    {
      "id": "b-160",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**You have too many projects going.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-161",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I know you said they're all happening in parallel, but here's the truth: **YC will see \"lack of focus\" as a red flag.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-162",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When they ask \"What are you working on?\" and you say \"Well, I have 6 projects and...\" they'll think:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-163",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"This person doesn't know what to build\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-164",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"They'll pivot 5 times in the batch\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-165",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"Not coachable—too attached to their ideas\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**YC wants founders who are OBSESSED with one problem.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-167",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "So if you're serious about YC, you need to:"
