      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Pick ONE project** (my vote: Nodebook)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Kill or pause the rest** (hard, but necessary)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Go all-in for 30 days**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Apply with real traction**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you're not willing to do that, **skip YC this batch** and keep building in parallel. Apply in 6-12 months when one project has undeniable traction."
        }
      ]
    },
